       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CICS.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TRANID PIC X(4) VALUE "CB00".
       01 WS-PGM PIC X(8) VALUE "LOGGER".
